Package: intune-zabbix-bridge
Version: 0.1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Infiltrator Projects
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), zabbix-sender, ca-certificates
Description: Read-only Microsoft Intune telemetry bridge for Zabbix
 Collects existing Microsoft Intune Windows reboot telemetry through Microsoft
 Graph and publishes fleet-level metrics to Zabbix. The bridge does not contact
 or control managed endpoints.
